    "title": "Our Roots: Dance drama captivates Hong Kong audiences - Chinadaily.com.cn",
    "text": "The Orphan of Zhao, a captivating dance drama recently performed at West Kowloon Cultural District's Xiqu Centre, combines classical Chinese dance with modern choreography to examine enduring themes, including loyalty and fate. In an exclusive interview with China Daily, Feng Li, president of the China National Opera and Dance Drama Theater, says that the city can act as a carrier for culture exchanges — an advantage unmatched by any other international city.",
